title-matte.patch: the OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE* knobs that draw the thumbnail
title in the game's 3D letter font into the supersampled scene target.

Pin: applies to openpete 14340c09d (git apply). thumbnail.py's `title`
step creates a throwaway worktree at that revision, applies this patch,
builds the engine, renders the title over black and over white, and
removes the worktree. Not for master.

Knobs:
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE        lines separated by '|'
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_CAPS   cap height per line, overlay units (window
                              height = 1), comma list, last repeats (0.12)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_LEAD   centre-to-centre step, times the larger cap (1.25)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_Y      block centre, overlay units (0.5)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_SPACE  word gap, times the line's cap (0.45)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_TINT   RRGGBB (the menu title's gold)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_LIGHT  fixed = the font's fixed light, else the
                              rotating specular light
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_PHASE  frozen specular phase (unset: live)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_WOB    frozen per-glyph yaw ripple phase (unset: upright)
  OPENPETE_VIDEO_TITLE_BG     RRGGBB: the scene is not drawn; the target is
                              cleared to this colour under the title

diff --git a/core/include/openpete_native_render.h b/core/include/openpete_native_render.h
index eec6a4925..34de2f761 100644
--- a/core/include/openpete_native_render.h
+++ b/core/include/openpete_native_render.h
@@ -733,6 +733,11 @@ int  openpete_native_perf_anchor(void);
  * @param verts Triangle list, 3 vertices per triangle.
  * @param nverts Vertex count; 0 clears. */
 void openpete_native_set_mod_overlay(const openpete_hud_vert *verts, int nverts);
+/** @brief Publishes the video title's glyph vertices (x relative to the window centre), drawn into the supersampled scene target.
+ *
+ * @param verts The vertices, or NULL to clear.
+ * @param nverts The vertex count. */
+void openpete_native_set_title_glyphs(const openpete_hud_vert *verts, int nverts);
 
 /** @brief Return the window aspect (width over height) for overlay-space layout.
  *
diff --git a/core/renderer/native_render.c b/core/renderer/native_render.c
index 9b1806a..8f26394 100644
